    "id": "wep-mcq-251",
    "questionNumber": 251,
    "question": "The potential energy of a system is represented as $U(x) = a - b x^2$, where $a$ and $b$ are positive constants. The conservative force acting on the particle is:",
    "options": {
      "A": "2 b x",
      "B": "-2 b x",
      "C": "k x",
      "D": "a b x"
    },
