    "id": "wep-mcq-341",
    "questionNumber": 341,
    "question": "A light vertical spring of stiffness $k = 500\\text{ N/m}$ is attached to a ceiling. A mass $m = 2\\text{ kg}$ is hung from its lower relaxed end and released from rest. The maximum extension of the spring is ($g = 10\\text{ m/s}^2$):",
